    <item>
      <title>[신문으로 배우는 실용한자] 기면증(嗜眠症)</title>
      <link>https://www.chosun.com/national/nie/chinese_character/2026/10/23/BGOZOU74V5ECZFCEALW3UJGUQY/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.chosun.com/national/nie/chinese_character/2026/10/23/BGOZOU74V5ECZFCEALW3UJGUQY/</guid>
      <dc:creator>조선일보</dc:creator>
      <description/>
      <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:34:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img align="center" src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/DBDFOFXI55EVZB5OS6HNXY45IU.jpg"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</content:encoded>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[매일매일 중국어 한마디] 과창판(과학기술주 중심 증권시장)</title>
